Problem. The hunter content PRs (implings, bird houses, traps, Herbiboar,
butterflies, Hunters' Rumours) each add to the same new module. If each
of them created the module, any two would conflict.

Change. The empty content/skills/hunter module and its pack: the two
build.gradle.kts files (the module needs api plugin-commons, utils-skills and
content/quest, the pack engine/map) and the two gamevals.toml files with
their sections and one anchor comment per feature, so that each feature
PR adds its ids under its own anchor and any of them merge in any order.
This commit adds no content; it is the base for the hunter PRs.

Tests. None (no code). The module builds empty.

Data sources. None.

Caveats. None.

